#: kcmstyle.cpp:117
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:status"
msgid "Installation failed: Cannot install a style from a remote location."
msgstr "መጫኑ አልተሳካም፦ ከርቀት ቦታ ስታይል መጫን አይቻልም።"

